/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
*.iml
.idea

# Per-project cache state, generated on first use by any run that resolves a
# `cache` volume mount — including the fixtures the test suites run against.
# The file itself says not to commit it: the key is per-checkout, and sharing
# one would point unrelated machines at the same Docker volumes.
.batect/

# The `/output` bind the two run-as-current-user conformance projects write
# into. Upstream Batect points that mount at its own Gradle build tree; here
# the harness creates and removes a project-local directory instead, so a
# crashed run leaves one behind rather than dirtying `git status`.
ratect-compat/tests/conformance/batect-journey/*/output/

# Python bytecode from tools/ (see AGENTS.md guideline 15).
__pycache__/
